@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+# ADR-012 Single successful payment per order
+
+- **Status:** Accepted (TASK-010)
+- **Context:** Multiple Payment aggregates can exist for one order; MarkOrderPaid must be safe.
+- **Decision:** An order may be marked paid once. A second MarkOrderPaid with the **same** payment id is idempotent. A different payment id on an already-paid order is rejected (`InvalidOrderState`). Product policy: one capturing payment per order for now.
+- **Consequences:** `sales_orders.payment_id` stores the winning payment; CompletePayment may be called twice safely for the same payment.
